<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pitney Bowes cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pitney Bowes cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette downgraded Pitney Bowes Inc to neutral from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Pitney Bowes lost 7/8 to 64-1/4.</p>
</text>
